<title>USA: TABLE - Owens Corning Q2 shr down.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Owens Corning Q2 shr down.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.11		    $1.25</p>
<p> Net			 63,000		   69,000</p>
<p> Net sales	    1,017,000		  956,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs prim	   53,800		   51,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs dil	    58,500		   51,500</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.87		     1.98</p>
<p> Net			105,000		  108,000</p>
<p> Net sales	    1,892,000		1,805,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs prim	   53,600		   51,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs dil	    58,200		   51,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Owens Corning.</p>
<p>1996 second-quarter and six-month net and shr excludes after-tax $542 million charge related to post-1999 asbestos litigation claims.</p>
<p>Including the charge, 1996 Q2 diluted share would be a loss of $9.19 and a loss of $8.43 for the six-month period.</p>
<p>Including the charge, 1997 Q2 primary shr was a profit of $1.17 and a loss of $9.19 for the six-month period. 1996 Q2 primary shr was a profit of $1.96 and a loss of $8.43 for the six-month period.</p>
<p>The company did not provide primary shr figures that exclude the charge.</p>
</text>
